ame-type=\"\" data-text=\"Λεύκιος\"><span data-text=\"Λεύκιος\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"\">ΛΕΥΚΙΟΣ</span></span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Καύλιος\"><span data-text=\"Καύλιος\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"\">ΚΑΥΛΙΟΣ</span></span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Λευκίου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Λευκίου\"><span data-text=\"Λευκίου\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"\">ΛΕΥΚΙΟΥ</span></span></span></span><br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Χαιρήτιος Χαιρητίου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Χαιρήτιος\"><span data-text=\"Χαιρήτιος\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"\">ΧΑΙΡ.ΤΙΟΣ</span></span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Χαιρητίου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Χαιρητίου\"><span data-text=\"Χαιρητίου\" data-n=\"75\" data-lemma=\"\">ΧΑΙΡΗΤΙΟΥ</span></span></span></span><br id=\"al6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Λύκων Νύμφωνος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Λύκων\"><span data-text=\"Λύκων\" data-n=\"80\" data-lemma=\"\">ΛΥΚΩΝ</span></span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Νύμφωνος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Νύμφωνος\"><span data-text=\"Νύμφωνος\" data-n=\"85\" data-lemma=\"\">ΝΥΜΦΩΝΟΣ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic003013_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic003013_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic003013.jpg\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic003013-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic003013_frontal_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic003013_frontal_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic003013_frontal.jpg\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic003013_frontal-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic003013_left_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic003013_left_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic003013_left.jpg\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic003013_left-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic003013_right_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic003013_right_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic003013_right.jpg\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic003013_right-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic003013_rear_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic003013_rear_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic003013_rear.jpg\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic003013_rear-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>Text from autopsy</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</a></p>  <p>The 'prostatai' of Demeter: Gaios Orkeios, son of Gaios; Gaios Solpikios, son of Gaios; Leukios Kaulios, son of Leukios; Chairetios son of Chairetios; Lykon son of Nymphon</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The statue is one of three found together close to the coast at Contrada Borgelusa di Avola, in the immediate vicinity of the site of a first-century BC Roman villa (which had an earlier Hellenistic building underneath). The other two statues are Kore and a youthful Herakles. Demeter holds a huge torch in her right hand and piglet in left. The inscription lists five prostatai (guardians of the shrine)of Damater (Demeter). The first three names are Latin / Roman: Gaius Orceius, Gaius Sulpicius, and Lucius Caulius. Gentili (1954) records the discovery; a Roman villa was subsequently excavated in the immediate vicinity. Manganaro (2009) is the most recent discussion, dating the statue to the second century BC.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Gentili 1954 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001958\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001958</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1977 159 ph <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001440\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001440</a>  </li><li> 1984 34.0981 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796</a>  </li><li> Bacci 1984-1985 713 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002175\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002175</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 2001 86 no.V <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001806\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001806</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 2009 114 ph <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001796</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> <p>Alpha has broken bar; epsilon and sigma are lunate; omega is lightly but clearly rhomboid; omicron is smaller than the other letters and sits above the line; phi is extended well above and below the line.</p> <p> Types list: <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Α-type2.html\" target=\"_blank\">Α type2</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Γ-type2.html\" target=\"_blank\">Γ type2</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Γ-type2.2.html\" target=\"_blank\">Γ type2.2</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ε-type3.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ε type3</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ε-type3.1.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ε type3.1</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ε-type3.3.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ε type3.3</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Κ-type1.html\" target=\"_blank\">Κ type1</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Κ-type1.1.html\" target=\"_blank\">Κ type1.1</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Λ-type2.html\" target=\"_blank\">Λ type2</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Μ-type3.html\" target=\"_blank\">Μ type3</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Μ-type3.1.html\" target=\"_blank\">Μ type3.1</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ν-type2.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ν type2</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ν-type2.2.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ν type2.2</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ο-type1.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ο type1</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Π-type2.html\" target=\"_blank\">Π type2</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Π-type2.1.html\" target=\"_blank\">Π type2.1</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Π-type2.2.html\" target=\"_blank\">Π type2.2</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ρ-type1.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ρ type1</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ρ-type1.1.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ρ type1.1</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Σ-type4.html\" target=\"_blank\">Σ type4</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Τ-type2.html\" target=\"_blank\">Τ type2</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Τ-type2.1.html\" target=\"_blank\">Τ type2.1</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Υ-type2.html\" target=\"_blank\">Υ type2</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Υ-type2.1.html\" target=\"_blank\">Υ type2.1</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Φ-type2.html\" target=\"_blank\">Φ type2</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Φ-type2.2.html\" target=\"_blank\">Φ type2.2</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Χ-type3.html\" target=\"_blank\">Χ type3</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ω-type2.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ω type2</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ω-type2.3.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ω type2.3</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ω-type2.3.2.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ω type2.3.2</a> </p> Line 1  8-13    ?  Lines 2-6  5-9  </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
